1
00:00:43,640 --> 00:00:45,280
Chen Lang, you're awake

2
00:00:46,320 --> 00:00:47,120
How are you feeling?

3
00:00:48,040 --> 00:00:49,120
Is it a headache?

4
00:00:50,680 --> 00:00:51,600
Where am I?

5
00:00:53,120 --> 00:00:54,680
You're in your own room

6
00:00:55,240 --> 00:00:56,440
Let me massage it for you

7
00:01:04,920 --> 00:01:05,720
No...

8
00:01:06,360 --> 00:01:08,680
How did Li Zhi'an know my entire plan?

9
00:01:12,800 --> 00:01:13,640
Don't panic, Chen Lang

10
00:01:15,280 --> 00:01:17,840
I've sent a trusted physician to examine her

11
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:21,160
Li Zhi'an has lost her memory from extreme shock

12
00:01:21,560 --> 00:01:22,520
Everything you said

13
00:01:22,520 --> 00:01:23,720
She remembers none of it

14
00:01:24,040 --> 00:01:25,200
It's definitely not an act

15
00:01:26,440 --> 00:01:30,000
So she was truly... by my mother?

16
00:01:31,040 --> 00:01:32,480
Though this matter is strange

17
00:01:33,000 --> 00:01:35,680
We have no choice but to believe it now

18
00:01:35,960 --> 00:01:40,360
The Li family's old faction and Long Yu's status remain uncertain

19
00:01:41,400 --> 00:01:44,640
Chen Lang, you mustn't act rashly

20
00:01:50,160 --> 00:01:54,320
Zhu Huaijin repeatedly opposed the Ancestral Temple plan yesterday

21
00:01:55,040 --> 00:01:57,600
Did he later meet with Li Zhi'an?

22
00:01:58,880 --> 00:01:59,800
Where is he now?

23
00:02:00,440 --> 00:02:01,240
Summon him for questioning

24
00:02:02,160 --> 00:02:04,600
The Imperial Ancestral Temple caught fire before Li Zhi'an's worship ceremony

25
00:02:05,040 --> 00:02:06,760
His Majesty considers this an ominous sign

26
00:02:07,160 --> 00:02:10,680
While Chen Lang was unconscious, officials were already summoned to investigate

27
00:02:11,280 --> 00:02:14,680
The Seventh Prince took responsibility for Chen Lang

28
00:02:15,080 --> 00:02:16,680
He has already entered the palace to receive punishment

29
00:02:23,160 --> 00:02:23,960
Enough

30
00:02:26,200 --> 00:02:27,040
You may leave

31
00:02:33,640 --> 00:02:34,440
Father Emperor

32
00:02:36,120 --> 00:02:38,280
How dare you set fire to the Imperial Ancestral Temple!

33
00:02:38,920 --> 00:02:40,720
You've jeopardized Nanliang's national fortune

34
00:02:41,800 --> 00:02:42,720
Your son admits his wrongdoing

35
00:02:43,240 --> 00:02:46,840
Did you do this for that woman from Beijin?

36
00:02:49,480 --> 00:02:50,280
Father Emperor

37
00:02:51,360 --> 00:02:52,520
Those who aspire to greatness

38
00:02:52,600 --> 00:02:54,000
Must have no weaknesses

39
00:02:54,440 --> 00:02:55,600
You should understand this

40
00:02:56,080 --> 00:02:57,760
I permitted her to come to Nanliang

41
00:02:58,320 --> 00:03:01,520
Precisely for the Li family's Dragon Jade treasure

42
00:03:02,840 --> 00:03:06,080
Your task is to find the Dragon Jade and present it to me

43
00:03:07,040 --> 00:03:09,640
If she dares to step out of line again

44
00:03:09,880 --> 00:03:11,720
I will personally deal with her

45
00:03:12,280 --> 00:03:13,880
The treasure I cannot obtain

46
00:03:14,560 --> 00:03:17,600
No one in this world shall have it either

47
00:03:18,600 --> 00:03:21,440
Father, your son is not shielding Li Zhi'an

48
00:03:21,840 --> 00:03:23,120
But the situation is urgent

49
00:03:23,320 --> 00:03:24,960
Zhu Huaichen has already colluded with Western Yu

50
00:03:25,440 --> 00:03:27,440
If he were to discover the location of the Dragon Jade Treasure

51
00:03:27,840 --> 00:03:29,440
The consequences would be irreversible

52
00:03:32,080 --> 00:03:34,680
Here is evidence of Zhu Huaichen's collusion with Western Yu

53
00:03:35,520 --> 00:03:36,560
For your review, Father

54
00:03:49,280 --> 00:03:53,080
To use my own hand to kill my son

55
00:03:54,040 --> 00:03:56,680
This is your scheme?

56
00:03:57,760 --> 00:03:58,560
Your son wouldn't dare

57
00:04:01,960 --> 00:04:05,280
Your task isn't merely to defeat your rival

58
00:04:05,840 --> 00:04:08,480
But to preserve the dignity of Southern Liang

59
00:04:09,240 --> 00:04:11,200
If you truly wish to protect the kingdom

60
00:04:11,960 --> 00:04:13,640
You must address the root of the problem

61
00:04:15,080 --> 00:04:16,080
Understood

62
00:04:30,840 --> 00:04:32,920
This is the Imperial Guard token

63
00:04:34,240 --> 00:04:36,640
I trust you won't disappoint me

64
00:04:41,480 --> 00:04:42,280
You may leave now.

65
00:04:44,440 --> 00:04:45,920
Your son thanks Your Majesty for your grace.

66
00:04:46,680 --> 00:04:47,840
I shall not fail the imperial command.

67
00:04:55,880 --> 00:04:58,480
Your son takes his leave.

68
00:05:16,480 --> 00:05:17,280
Your Majesty,

69
00:05:17,480 --> 00:05:20,920
You clearly helped the Seventh Prince cover up the traces at the Imperial Ancestral Temple,

70
00:05:21,160 --> 00:05:24,400
and had long obtained evidence of the Third Prince's collusion with Western Yu.

71
00:05:24,680 --> 00:05:26,400
Why not punish them?

72
00:05:29,080 --> 00:05:31,280
Among the princes under my rule,

73
00:05:31,520 --> 00:05:33,800
the most outstanding is Huaichen,

74
00:05:35,040 --> 00:05:37,920
but he was born of that Northern Jin spy.

75
00:05:38,200 --> 00:05:39,680
Fortunately we have Huaijin,

76
00:05:39,840 --> 00:05:41,880
who managed to grow strong despite adversity,

77
00:05:42,320 --> 00:05:45,000
ensuring the continuation of Nanliang's imperial lineage.

78
00:05:45,800 --> 00:05:48,840
Only he's not yet sharp enough.

79
00:05:48,880 --> 00:05:52,160
And Huaichen happens to be his perfect whetstone.

80
00:05:52,600 --> 00:05:53,800
Given time,

81
00:05:53,920 --> 00:05:57,280
Huaijin will shatter this whetstone himself.

82
00:05:57,480 --> 00:06:02,520
Only then will he be worthy of safeguarding Nanliang for generations to come.

83
00:06:03,760 --> 00:06:05,000
Your Majesty is most wise.

84
00:06:24,080 --> 00:06:24,880
Seventh

85
00:06:26,480 --> 00:06:27,840
What brings you here?

86
00:06:29,240 --> 00:06:31,760
Who is Huamei?

87
00:06:41,280 --> 00:06:44,760
Perhaps I should go back and have Huamei apply the medicine for me

88
00:06:48,000 --> 00:06:50,080
Let me tend to your wounds, my lord

89
00:06:56,200 --> 00:06:58,040
Does my lord find me unworthy?

90
00:06:59,560 --> 00:07:00,800
Not at all

91
00:07:23,240 --> 00:07:25,000
The letter from the Western Envoy is missing

92
00:07:26,480 --> 00:07:27,960
He just came from the palace

93
00:07:28,400 --> 00:07:30,200
Could he have really given it to Emperor Nanliang?

94
00:07:31,040 --> 00:07:32,160
But if Emperor Nanliang knew

95
00:07:32,160 --> 00:07:34,640
that Zhu Huaichen was colluding with the Western Envoy

96
00:07:34,800 --> 00:07:36,120
he would surely have taken action

97
00:07:36,760 --> 00:07:38,920
Unless he's deliberately turning a blind eye

98
00:07:40,120 --> 00:07:41,200
But why would he?

99
00:08:28,080 --> 00:08:30,240
This is the Imperial Guard token

100
00:08:31,000 --> 00:08:33,080
Since when does Zhu Huaijin command the Imperial Guard?

101
00:08:35,440 --> 00:08:38,440
Did he exchange the letter for command of the Imperial Guard?

102
00:08:39,000 --> 00:08:41,480
Why is the Emperor of Nanliang acting so strangely?

103
00:08:42,080 --> 00:08:43,200
On one hand punishing him

104
00:08:43,440 --> 00:08:44,760
while on the other rewarding him

105
00:09:07,760 --> 00:09:08,840
These injuries are quite severe

106
00:09:10,560 --> 00:09:13,720
I grew up in the Li family military camp with my father

107
00:09:14,200 --> 00:09:15,160
What kind of injury is this

108
00:09:15,160 --> 00:09:17,040
I can tell just by touching it with my eyes closed

109
00:09:18,000 --> 00:09:21,840
Husband, this wound feels like it was caused by military cane punishment

110
00:09:22,520 --> 00:09:24,400
When Huamei brought you here earlier

111
00:09:24,680 --> 00:09:26,120
I heard him shouting

112
00:09:26,120 --> 00:09:27,960
that your injury is related to me

113
00:09:28,840 --> 00:09:30,000
What exactly happened

114
00:09:31,400 --> 00:09:32,640
Don't listen to his nonsense

115
00:09:33,280 --> 00:09:34,640
This matter has nothing to do with you

116
00:09:44,720 --> 00:09:45,960
If you won't tell me the truth

117
00:09:50,720 --> 00:09:51,520
I...

118
00:09:54,040 --> 00:09:58,160
It's... it's because you fainted at the ancestral temple that day

119
00:09:58,760 --> 00:10:00,680
I was in such a hurry to save you

120
00:10:01,000 --> 00:10:02,800
that I knocked over the candlestick

121
00:10:03,160 --> 00:10:04,400
causing the ancestral temple to catch fire

122
00:10:05,080 --> 00:10:05,960
The Emperor was furious

123
00:10:05,960 --> 00:10:07,040
so he punished me

124
00:10:08,000 --> 00:10:09,080
This wasn't your fault

125
00:10:09,920 --> 00:10:10,960
Don't blame yourself

126
00:10:12,360 --> 00:10:14,400
So he was the one who caused the ancestral temple fire

127
00:10:15,120 --> 00:10:16,320
Why would he do that

128
00:10:17,360 --> 00:10:19,040
Could it really have been for me

129
00:10:19,640 --> 00:10:21,320
I can't figure out the reason

130
00:10:22,440 --> 00:10:24,960
Surely it couldn't have been for my sake

131
00:10:29,960 --> 00:10:30,760
Oh no

132
00:10:31,680 --> 00:10:33,480
I accidentally hurt you, husband

133
00:10:33,480 --> 00:10:34,280
It's alright

134
00:10:35,040 --> 00:10:35,840
I'm not in pain

135
00:10:37,560 --> 00:10:41,920
Zhu Huaijin, whether your injuries were for me or not

136
00:10:42,640 --> 00:10:43,440
this kindness

137
00:10:44,600 --> 00:10:45,400
I will remember it
